<div class="split-head"><h2 id="bring-h">A few practical things.</h2></div>
<div class="split-body">
<ul class="plain-list">
<li><b>How long is a session?</b> Individual OT is one hour. Consulting is <span class="todo-inline">{{ site.services[1].unit }}</span>.</li>
<li><b>Who needs to be home?</b> At least one parent or caregiver. Siblings and pets are fine and often useful.</li>
<li><b>What should I have ready?</b> Nothing in particular. If we're working on a specific routine, it helps to schedule the session for when that routine actually happens.</li>
<li><b>What do you bring?</b> Whatever the goals call for. A lot of the work uses your own things on purpose, because those are the things your child has to manage after I go.</li>
<li><b>What if we're mid-way through an assessment or waiting on early intervention?</b> That's a common place to start, and it doesn't conflict. I'm glad to coordinate with anyone else involved.</li>
</ul>
